The above repro code provides a simple callbacks of Subject.doAs() to show what's the issue. A real example of callback is below. It works fine in VM, but not in native image. 

    Subject.doAs(subject, new PrivilegedExceptionAction<GSSCredential>() {
        @Override
        public GSSCredential run() throws Exception
        {
            GSSManager manager = GSSManager.getInstance();
            return manager.createCredential(GSSCredential.INITIATE_ONLY);

        }
    });
